{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-08_beg","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-08","title":"以命换命","storyCode":"11-9","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b2912302e8a32e05212f4af2dfbf3cf0551892d82e1d5e00957b0609413ac590","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"艾尔希！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坚持住，我，我马上就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我答应过你的，我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛，马上离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"血魔在靠近，你不能被发现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"艾尔希还在这里，我必须——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你必须遵守她的命令，她不会允许你自作主张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，你们不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们能。我们听从公爵的命令来协助你“完成任务”，不是你的仆人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别忘记她是怎么教你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别忘记你的立场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你必须做的只有一件事，那就是完成你的使命。"},{"type":"narration","text":"在某一个瞬间，阿勒黛忘了自己在哪里，身边又站着谁。\n她很想往前跑，很想冲进那场正在夺走她残余人生的大火里。\n就像二十六年前的那个夜晚，她想要冲进另一片火光中，阻止议会的士兵带走父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至于其他的事，你早就没有资格了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿勒黛睁大眼睛，她眼中的泪水被火焰烤干了。\n但她确实无疑地看到，燃烧的花园中，正有一个巨大的身影拔地而起。\n是那具残损的蒸汽甲胄吗？是曾经凝集着她无数幻想与奢望的蒸汽甲胄吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"回到目标人物的身边，马上。"},{"type":"narration","text":"在无数艰难的时刻，阿勒黛用尽全身力气祈祷，希望那位伟大的先祖会重新降临到蒸汽甲胄之上，帮她渡过难关。\n现在，她看到了，古老的铠甲，正喷吐着最可怖的烈焰。\n她看见了火焰之中的阴影正对自己咆哮。\n那不是她的希望，她早已渐行渐远。\n倘若祖先真的归来——\n阿勒黛知道，那只会是她的梦魇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"告诉她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会一如既往，遵循她的意愿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不明白，大君阁下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为您对我们的招待十分满意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"您甚至会偶尔光顾我们的舞会，不是吗？您是喜欢这里的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不得不承认，你们一度给我带来了一些快乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们那些小心的谄媚，夸张的示好，都曾让我心生怜爱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"您是不是弄错了什么？我跟大公爵与反抗军绝无一丝一毫的牵扯！我保证......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"要真的有什么问题，那也是那个姓坎伯兰的女人做的！我可以向您检举她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"大人......阁下......什么都好，您行行好吧，想要什么我都可以给您！我的那些收藏品，我的钱，都请您拿去！只求您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亲爱的，我要这些做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"您不会杀了我的，对吧？我们还可以继续举办那些酒会，您一定还没有尝过我珍藏的酒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"莱托中校，我会没事的，对吧，这里是伦蒂尼姆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"他们，萨卡兹们只是受到卡文迪许公爵那个倒霉蛋邀请，来保护伦蒂尼姆的，他们从不滥杀无辜，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带去前面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太吵了。快些开始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"开、开始什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等听到命令，你就往里面跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能顺利跑进房子里，确定里面没有活人的话，你就也能活着出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"里面......您是说火里？您让我跑进这么大的火里？不，我不会跑的，我不想被烧死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会照做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"narration","text":"古老的萨卡兹站在维多利亚的心脏上，轻轻抬了抬手指。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他没有看清身后在追逐着他的是什么。\n就像萨卡兹战士说的那样，他的确本能地遵守了指令，拼命往前跑去。\n前面是火，火里至少还有一丝生机。正在追着他的才是绝对的死亡的气息。\n但他的脚步还是太慌乱，没跑几步就跌倒了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鲜血自他身体内部迸发了出来。\n它们不再属于原本的主人，而是成了另一个人的仆从。\n在他的指挥下扑向面前的大地，扑向崩塌着的宅邸，扑向凶猛的大火，咬碎残垣，吞下残枝，盖住灰烬。\n血液在行军，而且无人可挡，就连火焰都不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱托，他说得对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没尝过他珍藏的酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们该去尝尝的，不是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"到了，在这里等着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隆德，查理......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就是你们打算处决我们的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎么知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还不简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两年下来，你们从来没有让工人们知道你们在造什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们这些领头的工人，却也多多少少知道了一些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近催得这么紧，恐怕是已经接近尾声了吧，既然如此，我们这些知道太多的人，也就该死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......你刚才骗了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，只是处理了一点后事而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这些工人任劳任怨了三年，能掀起什么风浪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"别想给我耍花招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"来几个人，跟我去外面看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒，给我看着她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能抽烟吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有想过逃跑吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃跑？跑去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我如果逃跑了，我工厂里的那些工人就遭殃了，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在想，你们会怎么对待我们，看起来，你们上面的人还挺有人情味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样算是......有人情味吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你们下命令的人应该说过，不要在工人里掀起恐慌，所以才会把我们聚集在一起悄悄处理掉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我的一条命，能换来更多工人继续活下去，那就这样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为其他被你们带来的老东西，心里不明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，你今年几岁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你知道蒸汽骑士的故事吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"知道。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"听过一些。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶曾经是打造蒸汽甲胄的工人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对过去的我们来说，这是一种认可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为守护这座伦蒂尼姆，守护我们家园的战士，他们的甲胄是由我们的双手打造出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经也憧憬着，有一天我能像奶奶那样，能亲眼看见那些伟大的事物诞生......能亲身参与其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶经历了很多事，她是看着伦蒂尼姆如何一步步走到现在的。我看得出来她很失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我......我还不想这么快就放弃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是这个抽屉吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暗格，暗格......哦，找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是奶奶，一般人根本没法发现这张桌子被改造过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......我的工牌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一本......笔记本？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你是在哥伦比亚长大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我是被我姥姥带大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的爸爸妈妈都是佣兵，不过他们都死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你为什么还要当佣兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我要养活我和姥姥呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许多地方都不欢迎萨卡兹，我就只好也来当佣兵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你也同意你们那个摄政王的做法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指占领这座城市吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是收钱办事，一开始，我都不知道，我们是要来占领这么大的一座城市的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在哥伦比亚，我们的任务也就是替一些见不得光的商人押送一些货物，或是猎杀野兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只记得，我头一回见到格林那么激动，是他跟我说，要是这次能成功，萨卡兹就能过上好日子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格林？那个爱抽烟的格林吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他人呢，有阵子没见到他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不难过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格林告诉过我，对我们雇佣兵来说，生离死别是很正常的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生离死别。哪怕这座城市混乱了这么些年，维多利亚人也一点都不懂萨卡兹啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接着，孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯瑟琳从烟盒里掏出了一件小东西，抛给明椒。\n那样东西小小的，软软的，是毛线织成的，颜色还很鲜艳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......指套......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格林......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你给那个上了年纪的雇佣兵织的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他食指受过伤，会痛，但也戒不了烟。我见他把这玩意儿藏在烟盒里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概他也舍不得用，浪费了你的心意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他走的时候，把烟盒给了我，当作那几个月的烟钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他从来没跟我提过你，但第一眼见到你，我就明白过来，他心里一直惦记着的孩子是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......才不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道他对这场战争怎么看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我知道，孩子，他不用说我就知道......你还不理解，战争是什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，在我决定带你回来之前，我想过许多要和奶奶说的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来以为自己已经有了觉悟，这么长时间，我们经历了足够多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我现在觉得，我还是欠她一句道歉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你们是亲人。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她并不需要你的道歉，不是吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯瑟琳永远都是板着脸的样子，很多人都忘记了，她只是个失去了生活的普通人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这个，博士！奶奶在地图上圈出了好几个位置——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这些地点必定戒备森严。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我们要接近停靠站恐怕很困难。"}]},{"label":"希望另一边能有所收获。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，即使我们无法靠近，奶奶留下的这些信息也足够有帮助了。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然想要和奶奶告别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，就留到下次吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们该回去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我一起的雇佣兵，有许多人其实都不清楚我们到底是来为什么而战的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是没有地方去了。哪里都不欢迎我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而萨卡兹的王说，我们可以有个归处，可以被统治，可以找到未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你们之中的一些人相处过，看得出来，他们有些甚至没有参与过真正的战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会战斗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你杀过人吗，孩子？不是那种明确到可以不用有道德负担的恶徒，而是......人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是工人，你也没有杀过，不要用这种过来人的口气教训我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在伦蒂尼姆待了这么久，应该听说过蒸汽甲胄吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好像是很厉害的兵器，但是很久没有出现过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，但那是凶器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我曾亲手打造了那一台又一台的凶器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我并不为此感到羞愧，因为那些兵器被用来守护了我生活的土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，孩子，你知道你正在为了什么东西而挥动手中的凶器吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
